      "raw": "<p>playing the game the other night with a friend of mine (he&#39;d recently gotten the game and Season 1) we played a game, and i figured since I SO enjoy using G-pa Legacy(Or America&#39;s Greatest Legacy as it&#39;s actually called) we&#39;d go through a game to get him unlocked. we played through 2 games using the same team, Crono Ranger, Fanatic, Expatriat, and Tempest, obviously against Ambuscade in Silver Gulch.&nbsp;</p><p>Problem is: the first game we defeated him, one of the characters was at 9 HP, everyone else was below but still functioning: no unlock. i figured it was because i had put together the game. so we did it again, this time with him being the game put-togetherer person. again, defeated Ambuscade, noone was even at 9 HP, everyone was below but still alive. again, no unlock.&nbsp;</p><p>he&#39;d gotten the unlock today by himself, which made me think MAYBE it was just because there was multiple players in the game? I&#39;m not sure, but i&#39;m wondering if that&#39;s not an issue i may or may not have to look out for with later unlocks?</p><p>if it helps, i had already unlcoked G-pa Legacy, but we&#39;d been in games before where he got an unlock i had by being the player in control of that particular hero...</p>",
